  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TG - M&amp;E Capacity Strengthening</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This fund will be used to strenghten M&amp;E capacity of the Public Sector of the Republic of Togo. It is intended to develop an M&amp;E policy, MIS system and enhance capacity to facilitate evidence-based decision-making in the country&apos;s public sector.  Key expected outcomes are (i) use of M&amp;E information to improve public policy; (ii) enhanced capacity of policy makers, public sector managers and staff in carrying out and using the information to allocate resources and for budget management generally; and (iii) institutionalize M&amp;E culture and practice in the public sector of Togo</narrative>
  </description>
